  <ferc:DisclosureOfDetailsOnAccountingForIncomeTaxesTextBlock id="f-28" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;5. None.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfDetailsOnAccountingForIncomeTaxesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantRateOrOtherRegulatoryMattersTextBlock id="f-29" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:8.17pt"&gt;6. Effective July 1, 2025, TCNGL Pipeline&#8217;s maximum tariff rate for volumes transported from Receipt Points in Campbell and Converse Counties, Wyoming to delivery points in Converse County, Wyoming, was raised from $.01012647 per gallon to $.01019976 per gallon. For additional details regarding this tariff rate change, please refer to Docket No. IS25-608-000 on FERC&#8217;s eTariff Viewer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantRateOrOtherRegulatoryMattersTextBlock>
